  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math> is equal to"
