  "solution": {
    "text": "We have<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
